      "text": "10939"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "SurroundingArea",
      "text": "With a stay at The Clermont London, Victoria, you\u0027ll be centrally located in London, just a 2-minute walk from Victoria Station Travel Information Centre and 9 minutes by foot from Buckingham Palace.  This hotel is 0.7 mi (1.1 km) from Hyde Park and 0.5 mi (0.8 km) from St. James Park."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "RoomTypes",
      "text": "Make yourself at home in one of the 348 air-conditioned rooms featuring free minibar items and LCD televisions. Complimentary wireless internet access keeps you connected, and digital programming is available for your entertainment. Private bathrooms with bathtubs or showers feature rainfall showerheads and designer toiletries. Conveniences include phones, as well as laptop-compatible safes and desks."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PropertyInformation",
      "text": "Take advantage of recreation opportunities such as a fitness center, or other amenities including complimentary wireless internet access and concierge services. Additional features at this Victorian hotel include wedding services and a banquet hall."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "AreaActivities",
      "text": "Distances are displayed to the nearest 0.1 mile and kilometer. \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003Cp\u003EVictoria Station Travel Information Centre - 0.2 km / 0.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Apollo Victoria Theatre - 0.2 km / 0.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Buckingham Palace - 0.8 km / 0.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E St. James Park - 0.8 km / 0.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Hyde Park Corner - 1 km / 0.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Green Park - 1.1 km / 0.7 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Piccadilly - 1.1 km / 0.7 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Park Lane - 1.1 km / 0.7 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Hyde Park - 1.1 km / 0.7 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Sloane Square - 1.2 km / 0.7 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Westminster Abbey - 1.4 km / 0.8 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Houses of Parliament - 1.5 km / 0.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Harrods - 1.6 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Bond Street - 1.6 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Big Ben - 1.8 km / 1.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe nearest airports are:\u003Cbr /\u003ELondon City Airport (LCY) - 19.6 km / 12.2 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Heathrow Airport (LHR) - 26.5 km / 16.5 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Gatwick Airport (LGW) - 64.7 km / 40.2 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Luton Airport (LTN) - 56.7 km / 35.2 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Stansted Airport (STN) - 67 km / 41.7 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PoliciesDisclaimers",
      "text": "\u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EExtra-person charges may apply and vary depending on property policy\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGovernment-issued photo identification and a credit card may be required at check-in for incidental charges\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESpecial requests are subject to availability upon check-in and may incur additional charges; special requests cannot be guaranteed\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis property accepts credit cards and debit cards; cash is not accepted\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESafety features at this property include a fire extinguisher, a security system, a first aid kit, and window guards\u003C/li\u003E  \u003C/ul\u003E \u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EThis property welcomes guests of all sexual orientations and gender identities (LGBTQ\u002B friendly).\u003C/li\u003E \u003C/ul\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "DiningFacilities",
      "text": "Satisfy your appetite with local and international cuisine at The Soak, one of the hotel\u0027s 2 restaurants. Need to unwind? Take a break with a tasty beverage at one of the 3 bars/lounges. English breakfasts are served on weekdays from 6:30 AM to 10:30 AM and on weekends from 7:00 AM to 11:00 AM for a fee."
    }
  ],
